<div class="newsletter-box">
  <h2>Stay updated on Ahmedabad property</h2>
  <p>New locality guides and market notes, sent only when there is something useful to read.</p>
  <form class="newsletter-form" action="#" method="post" data-newsletter>
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="newsletter-email">Email</label>
    <input id="newsletter-email" type="email" name="email" required placeholder="Your email" autocomplete="email">
    <button class="btn btn-navy" type="submit">Notify me</button>
  </form>
  <p class="newsletter-note" hidden data-newsletter-ok>Thanks — we will be in touch when the list opens.</p>
</div>
